---
title: "capitalWithdrawal (High Level Sale Customer Journey)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: project requests capital withdrawal
    q_check_caller --> q_check_refund_ended: caller = projectAdmin
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_refund_ended --> q_check_not_canceled: block.timestamp > refundEndTime
    q_check_refund_ended --> q_revert_refund_active: refund period still active
    q_revert_refund_active --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_check_not_withdrawn: isCanceled = false
    q_check_not_canceled --> q_revert_canceled: sale is canceled
    q_revert_canceled --> [*]: revert SaleCanceled
    q_check_not_withdrawn --> q_calc_fees: capitalWithdrawn = false
    q_check_not_withdrawn --> q_revert_already: already withdrawn
    q_revert_already --> [*]: revert AlreadyWithdrawn
    q_calc_fees --> q_distribute_legion_fee: legionFee = capitalRaised * legionFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps / 10000
    q_distribute_legion_fee --> q_distribute_referrer_fee: transfer legionFee to legionFeeReceiver
    q_distribute_referrer_fee --> q_transfer_capital: transfer referrerFee to referrer
    q_transfer_capital --> q_mark_withdrawn: transfer remaining capital to projectAdmin
    q_mark_withdrawn --> [*]: capitalWithdrawn = true

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: Capital withdrawal only after refund period ends
        INV-002: Fee distribution must occur atomically with capital withdrawal
        INV-003: capitalRaised is set during results publication, not modifiable after
        INV-004: Pre-liquid sales allow early withdrawal before token supply
    end note
